  "statement": "I acknowledge the proposal to unify the audit trail duration to 7 years. While this aligns with our compliance goals, I maintain that RES-01's compliance with financial regulations is paramount and should remain intact. I support the suggestion for more energy-efficient logging strategies, which can help meet ethical standards. However, the integration of cloud solutions with local caching strategies must ensure that transparency in currency exchange (RES-07) is not compromised. I propose we work together to define these strategies clearly, ensuring all ethical and compliance requirements are upheld while optimizing performance.",
